WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.993
Check before you buy.

2
00:00:01.993 --> 00:00:05.460
Look for warning signs before you buy land.

3
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.087
Take the list to the land office or a lawyer.

4
00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:10.721
Step 1.

5
00:00:10.721 --> 00:00:11.493
Sign in.

6
00:00:11.493 --> 00:00:15.066
This service needs a citizen account.

7
00:00:15.066 --> 00:00:19.121
If you do not have one, register for free.

8
00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:20.612
Step 2.

9
00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:22.385
Enter the land details.

10
00:00:22.385 --> 00:00:25.391
Give the area, khatian and dag numbers.

11
00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:28.243
Add the seller's name if you know it.

12
00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:30.170
Then press Run checklist.

13
00:00:31.122 --> 00:00:31.738
Step 3.

14
00:00:31.738 --> 00:00:33.497
Read the indicators.

15
00:00:33.497 --> 00:00:37.104
Each row says Clear, Review or Indicator.

16
00:00:37.104 --> 00:00:42.207
If you see an indicator, get advice before you pay anyone.
